  "about": {
    "heading": "A little about Jo",
    "image": "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6365804e2c2e2b11a837808a/1667727124846-91VO2U4RFS6R2VVBINI4/A7404828.jpg?format=2500w",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Jo Colgan is a pianist who has played at venues all over Ireland. She has been resident pianist at the Slieve Donard Resort & Spa for more than two decades, and still plays most weekends in the hotel's restaurant, JJ's.",
      "Jo is a regular at weddings and events at the Slieve Donard and Hillsborough Castle. A highlight of her career was performing at the 25th anniversary celebrations of the Good Friday Agreement.",
      "She has also provided live piano accompaniment for professional choreographers at the MAC in Belfast, during an immersive training programme for Akram Khan."
    ],
    "quote": "Professional, accommodating and clearly very experienced.",
    "buttonText": "Get in touch →"
  },
